	return ret;</text>
Reason:
The fix redirects the failure of `of_get_mtd_device_by_node()` to a common cleanup label `out_free`, which calls `kfree(sys_controller)` to release the allocated memory before returning an error. Additionally, the same label is used to handle `mbox_request_channel()` failure, consolidating error handling and preventing any future leak in that path as well.

